+        Supports :meth:`fileno` by lazily backing itself with a real
+        temporary file, so the stream can be passed as ``stdout``/``stderr``
+        to :func:`subprocess.run` (or :class:`subprocess.Popen`) from code
+        under test. :issue:`3244`
